<title>POLAND: Polish food prices fall 0.2 pct in July 10-20.</title>
<headline>Polish food prices fall 0.2 pct in July 10-20.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food prices fell 0.2 percent in the July 10-20 period after falling 0.9 percent in the previous 10 days and were 2.5 percent lower than in the June 10-20 period, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.  </p>
<p>				   JULY 10-20  JULY 1-10   LAST 30 DAYS</p>
<p>POLISH FOOD PRICES (AVG)     -0.2	  -0.9	-2.5 (-3.8)</p>
<p> Bread				0.0	  -0.2	 0.2 (0.3)</p>
<p> Fruit and vegetables	  -3.0	  -6.9     -17.9 (-23.4)</p>
<p> Meat and meat-products	 0.5	   0.3	 1.0 (0.5)</p>
<p> Dairy products		   0.2	   0.3	 0.7 (0.7)</p>
<p> Eggs				-1.1	  -2.1     -14.9 (-5.6)</p>
<p>NOTE: In brackets are figures for the previous 30-day period ending on July 10.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
